      "comment": "Screen: Advanced recurrence. Meaning: Names the reconcile reminders action. Role: button title. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: VoiceOver announces this title for the control. Screenshot: Advanced recurrence button title state; no screenshot is claimed.",
