    "v30.asset.import.completed": {
      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Import committed and the durable completion receipt was confirmed.”. Role: operation-status message. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Shown in the operation-status card or status surface; normal VoiceOver traversal reads it, and focused status updates are announced. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. state where this operation-status message is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
