      "comment": "Screen: PartyContactSiteRoleImportView. Meaning: Speaks the complete severity, group, row, disposition, reason, and expected-revision summary for one import diagnostic. Role: combined diagnostic-row VoiceOver label. Arguments: severity: String, formattedPresentation, one value; group: String, formattedPresentation, one value; rowIndex: Int, formattedPresentation, one formatted number; disposition: String, opaqueIdentifier, one value; reason: String, opaqueIdentifier, one value; revision: String, opaqueIdentifier, one value. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Assigned directly to the combined diagnostic row and is the spoken row label. Screenshot: Concrete combined diagnostic-row VoiceOver label state on this screen; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
