    "v30.asset.import.diagnostic.disclosure": {
      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Every diagnostic is identified by group, row number, disposition, and a stable reason code.”. Role: visible explanatory Text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: This visible explanatory Text is available in normal VoiceOver traversal. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. state where this visible explanatory Text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
