      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Review the exact selected files and deterministic outcomes before any canonical write.”. Role: visible explanatory Text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: This visible explanatory Text is available in normal VoiceOver traversal. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. state where this visible explanatory Text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
