    "v30.asset.import.generic.failure": {
      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “The result could not be confirmed. Review the durable session and retry; no contact values are shown here.”. Role: focused error-status message. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Displayed in the relevant status or error surface; the implementation moves VoiceOver focus to the stated target. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. state where this focused error-status message is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
