    "v30.asset.import.retry.disclosure": {
      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Retry uses the same prepared binding and does not infer success from an unconfirmed result.”. Role: visible retry disclosure and VoiceOver hint. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: This visible text is available in normal VoiceOver traversal; the enclosing view controls any combined accessibility exposure. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. state where this visible retry disclosure and VoiceOver hint is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
