    "v30.asset.import.source.selection": {
      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “This prepared selection is immutable. Replacing a source requires a new prepared artifact.”. Role: visible explanatory Text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: This visible explanatory Text is available in normal VoiceOver traversal. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role import screen. state where this visible explanatory Text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
