    "v30.erase-all.all.photo.label": {
      "comment": "Screen: Erase local data. Meaning: provides the localized screen-specific label or explanatory guidance. Role: visible heading, label, or guidance. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: no. Screenshot: Erase local data rendered state; no screenshot is asserted.",
