    "v30.incumbent-file-adapter.cancelled": {
      "comment": "Screen: Data & Portability. Meaning: Reports cancelled to the user. Role: operation or state message. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Read as status content when the current operation or state is presented. Screenshot: Data & Portability operation or state message state; no screenshot is claimed.",
