            "value": "요청이 취소되었습니다. 다시 시도하기 전에 기준 기록을 다시 불러오세요. 변경이 반영되었다고 확인하지 않습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v30.incumbent-file-adapter.canonical-preview-complete": {
      "comment": "Screen: Data & Portability. Meaning: Reports canonical preview complete to the user. Role: operation or state message. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Read as status content when the current operation or state is presented. Screenshot: Data & Portability operation or state message state; no screenshot is claimed.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The C08 canonical-import preview completed with zero canonical writes. An explicit later command is still required."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
