    "v30.manual-work-resource.stock-disabled": {
      "comment": "Screen: Manual work resources. Meaning: Reports stock disabled to the user. Role: operation or state message. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Read as status content when the current operation or state is presented. Screenshot: Manual work resources operation or state message state; no screenshot is claimed.",
