    "v30.my-day.reorder-hint": {
      "comment": "Screen: My Day. Meaning: Guides use of the reorder hint control. Role: accessibility hint. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: VoiceOver announces this hint after the associated control label. Screenshot: My Day accessibility hint state; no screenshot is claimed.",
