            "value": "제공된 소스 잔액을 알 수 있을 때만 근거 있는 조정을 요청합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v30.parts-stock.archive": {
      "comment": "Screen: Parts & Stock. Meaning: Names the archive action. Role: button title. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: VoiceOver announces this title for the control. Screenshot: Parts & Stock button title state; no screenshot is claimed.",
