      "comment": "Screen: Parts & Stock. Meaning: Guides use of the draft material hint control. Role: accessibility hint. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: VoiceOver announces this hint after the associated control label. Screenshot: Parts & Stock accessibility hint state; no screenshot is claimed.",
