    "v30.parts-stock.return-quantity-heading": {
      "comment": "Screen: Parts & Stock. Meaning: Names the return quantity heading section. Role: section heading. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: The header trait and VoiceOver announce it as a section heading. Screenshot: Parts & Stock section heading state; no screenshot is claimed.",
