    "v30.parts-stock.search-too-long": {
      "comment": "Screen: Parts & Stock. Meaning: Maximum search query size. Role: validation error. Arguments: byteCount Int aggregateCount x1. Plural/select: English one/other for byteCount. Accessibility: Read when search field exceeds its byte limit.. Screenshot: Parts & Stock visible state.",
