            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "제공된 조회용 데이터가 최신이 아닙니다. 다시 시도하기 전에 다시 불러오세요. 일부만 반영되었다고 확인하지 않습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v30.parts-stock.write-storage-unavailable": {
      "comment": "Screen: Parts & Stock. Meaning: Reports write storage unavailable to the user. Role: operation or state message. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Read as status content when the current operation or state is presented. Screenshot: Parts & Stock operation or state message state; no screenshot is claimed.",
