    "v30.party.contact.workflow.no.impact.preview": {
      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role workflow screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “No impact preview is supplied. No Party, contact, Site-role, preferred-contact, merge, cascade, or saved-change claim is made.”. Role: visible Text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: This call itself adds visible Text; the enclosing view controls any combined accessibility exposure. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role workflow screen. state where this visible Text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
