    "v30.party.contact.workflow.operational.purpose.warning": {
      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role workflow screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Operational purpose only; no communication or marketing permission is implied.”. Role: derived impact-warning text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: The helper returns this string to the visible row or control that consumes it; VoiceOver reads that enclosing element normally. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role workflow screen. state where this derived impact-warning text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
