    "v30.party.contact.workflow.reversal.notice": {
      "comment": "Screen: Party/contact/Site-role workflow screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “The supplied Site-role reversal appends a successor tied to the prior role event; it does not erase the prior event.”. Role: button label. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: SwiftUI exposes it as the button label. Screenshot: Party/contact/Site-role workflow screen. state where this button label is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
