    "v30.paywall.subscription.benefits": {
      "comment": "Screen: Subscription offer paywall screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Unlimited local signs, checks, rechecks, and report generation while subscribed.”. Role: visible Text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: This call itself adds visible Text; the enclosing view controls any combined accessibility exposure. Screenshot: Subscription offer paywall screen. state where this visible Text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
