    "v30.punch.review.closeout.ready": {
      "comment": "Screen: Punch-review workflow screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Every scope decision and required finding state is ready for the next recorded closeout action.”. Role: visible Text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: This call itself adds visible Text; the enclosing view controls any combined accessibility exposure. Screenshot: Punch-review workflow screen. state where this visible Text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
