        }
      }
    },
    "v30.punch.review.closeout.unavailable": {
      "comment": "Screen: Punch-review workflow screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Closeout remains unavailable until every required scope decision and finding state is recorded.”. Role: visible Label title. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: SwiftUI combines the Label title with its symbol for accessibility. Screenshot: Punch-review workflow screen. state where this visible Label title is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
