    "v30.rating-support.reason-no-natural-stop": {
      "comment": "Screen: Rating and support. Meaning: Reports reason no natural stop to the user. Role: operation or state message. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Read as status content when the current operation or state is presented. Screenshot: Rating and support operation or state message state; no screenshot is claimed.",
