      "comment": "Screen: Service request. Meaning: Names the create work heading section. Role: section heading. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: The header trait and VoiceOver announce it as a section heading. Screenshot: Service request section heading state; no screenshot is claimed.",
