      "comment": "Screen: Service request. Meaning: Guides use of the refresh hint control. Role: accessibility hint. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: VoiceOver announces this hint after the associated control label. Screenshot: Service request accessibility hint state; no screenshot is claimed.",
