    "v30.signoff.enrollment.stale.revision": {
      "comment": "Screen: Signoff response enrollment screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “This completed-work revision is stale. Return to the detail and review the current immutable revision before recording a response.”. Role: derived revision-status text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: The helper returns this string to the visible row or control that consumes it; VoiceOver reads that enclosing element normally. Screenshot: Signoff response enrollment screen. state where this derived revision-status text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
