    "v30.signoff.enrollment.unavailable.revision": {
      "comment": "Screen: Signoff response enrollment screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “This completed-work revision is unavailable. Return to the detail and review the completed work before recording a response.”. Role: visible Text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: This call itself adds visible Text; the enclosing view controls any combined accessibility exposure. Screenshot: Signoff response enrollment screen. state where this visible Text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
