    "v30.startup.maintenance.message": {
      "comment": "Screen: Startup maintenance recovery screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “The app stopped to avoid changing or losing local records.”. Role: stored visible status text. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: The stored string supplies visible maintenance text at its later use. Screenshot: Startup maintenance recovery screen. state where this stored visible status text is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
