    "v30.subscription.status.grace.period.detail": {
      "comment": "Screen: Subscription status screen. Meaning: Uses the English default “Apple provided a signed grace period. Access does not continue beyond that signed date.”. Role: presentation title. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Supplied to the screen’s presentation model and read when that title is rendered. Screenshot: Subscription status screen. state where this presentation title is visible or announced; descriptive context only and not a screenshot-evidence claim.",
