      "comment": "Screen: Voice capture. Meaning: Reports no structured quantity to the user. Role: operation or state message. Arguments: none. Plural/select: none. Accessibility: Read as status content when the current operation or state is presented. Screenshot: Voice capture operation or state message state; no screenshot is claimed.",
